      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef solve(A, b):\n    try:\n        x = np.linalg.solve(np.array(A, dtype=float), np.array(b, dtype=float))\n    except np.linalg.LinAlgError:\n        return \"singular\"\n    return x.round(3).tolist()\n\nprint(solve([[2, 1], [1, 3]], [3, 5]))\nprint(solve([[1, 2], [2, 4]], [1, 2]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef solve(A, b):\n    try:\n        x = np.linalg.solve(np.array(A, dtype=float), np.array(b, dtype=float))\n    except np.linalg.LinAlgError:\n        return \"singular\"\n    return x.round(3).tolist()\n\nprint(solve([[2, 1], [1, 3]], [3, 5]))\nprint(solve([[1, 2], [2, 4]], [1, 2]))\n```"
    }
